WEBVTT

00:10:28.216 --> 00:10:30.541
and for the first few years
of practicing law.

00:10:30.565 --> 00:10:31.962
I was like, "This is great."

00:10:31.986 --> 00:10:37.198
I was doing the type of law where you're
putting deals together for companies.

00:10:37.222 --> 00:10:41.332
Some of the time, you're spending
hours alone in your office

00:10:41.356 --> 00:10:43.591
poring over a contract and drafting it.

00:10:43.615 --> 00:10:48.634
It’s funny, because over 50% of lawyers
are introverts, according to one study.

00:10:48.658 --> 00:10:50.285
There are lots of effective ones,

00:10:50.309 --> 00:10:54.234
and one of the ways that I first
started developing this whole thesis

00:10:54.258 --> 00:10:56.167
about the power of introversion

00:10:56.191 --> 00:11:00.394
is by watching the attorneys around me
for the whole time I was practicing